---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator or projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale already ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_set_end: sale not yet ended
    q_set_end --> q_calc_refund: hasEnded = true, endTime = block.timestamp
    q_calc_refund --> [*]: refundEndTime = endTime + refundPeriodSeconds, emit SaleEnded

    note right of q_set_end
        INV-001: sale end is irreversible
        INV-002: refund period starts immediately upon ending
    end note

    note right of q_calc_refund
        INV-003: refundEndTime calculated from endTime + configured duration
    end note
